    Stops MSBuild's walk up to the repository's Directory.Build.props, so a sample builds here exactly
    as it does in a reader's own folder: no warnings-as-errors, no documentation file, no package
    validation. test/consumer-smoke-test.sh copies each sample out of the repository before it builds
    it, so CI never depends on this file; it is for anyone who builds a sample in place.
-->
